  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 26280443904
    m_Localized: Press and hold the left button, then release it where you want to
      teleport.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3893969797120
    m_Localized: Push the right thumbstick left or right to rotate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4217510019072
    m_Localized: Turn your left hand toward your face to open the menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4270177894400
    m_Localized: Press and hold the lower button on the right controller to grab
      objects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 667402244947968
    m_Localized: Press and hold the A button on the right controller to speak. Release
      it when you finish your message.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
